## 1. Scenario & Objective
Newly hired mock employee made a critical operational security error. Making a social media post leaving their physical access badge in the image. Technical goal: Extract the badge data from the photograph, correct the skewed perspective, use AI to remove glare and obstructions, hallucinate the missing background elements, and assemble a native digital clone.

